#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt.field_res_company__l10n_sk_ekasa_hourly_budget
msgid ""
"Maximum lookups per clock hour. The service permits roughly 60 per hour per "
"IP address and blocks the address beyond that, so this module refuses to "
"exceed the budget rather than lose access. Note the real limit is per "
"address: several companies sharing one egress address share one budget."
msgstr ""
"Najväčší počet overení za hodinu. Služba povoľuje zhruba 60 za hodinu na IP "
"adresu a nad to adresu blokuje, preto tento modul limit radšej neprekročí, "
"než by prišiel o prístup. Skutočný limit platí pre adresu: viac spoločností "
"s jednou výstupnou adresou zdieľa jeden limit."

