#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt.field_res_company__l10n_sk_ekasa_ip_address
msgid ""
"The address declared to Finančná správa. Recorded here so the declaration "
"can be checked against the egress address actually in use."
msgstr ""
"Adresa oznámená finančnej správe. Zaznamenaná je tu, aby sa oznámenie dalo "
"porovnať so skutočne používanou výstupnou adresou."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt/models/res_company.py:0
msgid ""
"The eKasa receipt lookup is switched off for %s. Enable it in Settings ▸ "
"Accounting ▸ Fiscal Receipt Capture."
msgstr ""
"Overovanie dokladov v eKase je pre %s vypnuté. Zapnite ho v Nastavenia ▸ "
"Účtovníctvo ▸ Zachytávanie pokladničných dokladov."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt/models/sk_ekasa_call.py:0
msgid ""
"The hourly eKasa lookup budget for %(company)s is set to zero, so no lookups"
" are made. Raise it in Settings ▸ Accounting ▸ Fiscal Receipt Capture."
msgstr ""
"Hodinový limit overení v eKase pre %(company)s je nastavený na nulu, takže "
"sa neoveruje nič. Zvýšte ho v Nastavenia ▸ Účtovníctvo ▸ Zachytávanie "
"pokladničných dokladov."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt/models/sk_ekasa_call.py:0
msgid ""
"The hourly eKasa lookup budget for %(company)s is spent (%(used)s of "
"%(budget)s used since %(since)s). Finančná správa limits the service to "
"roughly 60 lookups per clock hour per IP address and blocks the address "
"beyond that, so the remaining receipts have to wait for the next hour."
msgstr ""
"Hodinový limit overení v eKase pre %(company)s je vyčerpaný (od %(since)s "
"použitých %(used)s z %(budget)s). Finančná správa obmedzuje službu na zhruba"
" 60 overení za hodinu na IP adresu a nad to adresu blokuje, preto zvyšné "
"doklady musia počkať na ďalšiu hodinu."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt.field_sk_ekasa_call__request_key
msgid "The identifier or composite key the service was asked about."
msgstr "Identifikátor alebo zložený kľúč, na ktorý sa služba pýtala."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt.res_config_settings_view_form_sk_ekasa
msgid ""
"The service allows roughly 60 lookups per clock hour per IP address and "
"blocks the address beyond that. Several companies sharing an egress address "
"share one real budget."
msgstr ""
"Služba povoľuje zhruba 60 overení za hodinu na IP adresu a nad to adresu "
"blokuje. Viac spoločností s jednou výstupnou adresou zdieľa jeden skutočný "
"limit."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt/models/cssk_receipt_provider_sk_ekasa.py:0
msgid ""
"The service answered but returned no receipt body. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Služba odpovedala, ale nevrátila telo dokladu. Nič sa nezmenilo."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt.field_sk_ekasa_call__return_value
msgid "The service's own returnValue field."
msgstr "Vlastné pole returnValue služby."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt/models/cssk_receipt_provider_sk_ekasa.py:0
msgid "The verification service answered with something that is not JSON."
msgstr "Overovacia služba odpovedala niečím, čo nie je JSON."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt/models/cssk_receipt_provider_sk_ekasa.py:0
msgid ""
"The verification service refused the request (HTTP %(status)s). This is "
"usually the service's firewall rather than the receipt."
msgstr ""
"Overovacia služba požiadavku odmietla (HTTP %(status)s). Zvyčajne je to "
"firewall služby, nie doklad."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt/models/cssk_receipt_provider_sk_ekasa.py:0
msgid "The verification service returned code %s."
msgstr "Overovacia služba vrátila kód %s."

#. module: l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_ekasa_receipt.field_res_company__l10n_sk_ekasa_ip_notified
msgid ""
"Tick once Finančná správa has been notified of the IP address this database "
"calls the verification service from, as act 384/2025 Z. z. § 18 ods. 11 "
"requires of an overovateľ."
msgstr ""
"Zaškrtnite, keď bola finančnej správe oznámená IP adresa, z ktorej táto "
"databáza volá overovaciu službu, ako to overovateľovi ukladá zákon č. "
"384/2025 Z. z. § 18 ods. 11."

